{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":2,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1463816468,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDE3OlJlbmFtZWRUaXRsZUV2ZW50NjY3ODg3OTQ0"},"title":"install doesn't do the right thing on crippled file systems","was":"install doesn't do the right thing on crippled file systems"},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1463816617,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIyMDc2NDI2Ng==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/258#issuecomment-220764266"},"message":"Reevaluated the situation with the current implementation of install: Better, but not good.\n\nInstalling a superdataset on a mounted samba share works, e.g.:\n\n```\ndatalad --source http://datasets.datalad.org/openfmri\n```\n\nWhen installing a subdataset, however, `git clone` goes into some kind of loop that looks like this in strace:\n\n```\ndatalad install ds000001\n....\n--- SIGALRM {si_signo=SIGALRM, si_code=SI_KERNEL} ---\nrt_sigreturn({mask=[]})                 = 1\nwrite(2, \"ub008/model/model001/onsets/task\"..., 54) = ? ERESTARTSYS (To be restarted if SA_RESTART is set)\n```\n\nNot sure what that is, but likely caused by the specific setup here.\n\nRedoing the same on `vfat` USB stick attached to a Debian box leads to:\n\n```\n2016-05-21 09:40:36,807 [DEBUG  ] Update cloned subdataset \u003cDataset path=/media/mih/USB DISK/openfmri/ds000001\u003e in parent (install.py:156)\n2016-05-21 09:40:36,808 [DEBUG  ] Running: ['git', '-c', 'receive.autogc=0', '-c', 'gc.auto=0', 'submodule', 'update', '--init', u'ds000001'] (cmd.py:351)\n2016-05-21 09:40:36,859 [DEBUG  ] stdout| Submodule 'ds000001' (http://datasets.datalad.org/openfmri/.git/ds000001) registered for path 'ds000001' (cmd.py:351)\n2016-05-21 09:40:36,861 [ERROR  ] [Errno 1] Operation not permitted [install.py:_fixup_submodule_dotgit_setup:220] (OSError) (main.py:235)\n```\n\nLooks like a genuine bug. Looking into it.","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1497266426,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMwNzc2MTY1NQ==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/258#issuecomment-307761655"},"message":"As reported in #1432 the word is a better place now.","files":null},{"type":4,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1497266426,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50MTExOTI3NzczMg=="},"status":2}]}